+- **Livewire:** validation, authorization and public properties in attendant panel — see stack security policy when `ai/` is in branch.
+## Authentication (implemented)
+
+- Staff sign in with e-mail + password through session auth (Livewire full-page `login`/`register`; no starter kit). E-mails are stored lowercase.
+- New accounts are created **unverified** and must verify their e-mail (`MustVerifyEmail`) before reaching `home` (`auth` + `verified`).
+- Passwords: minimum 8 characters with letters, mixed case and numbers (`Password::defaults()`).
+- Failed logins are limited to 5 per lowercase e-mail + IP; registration to 5 attempts per IP; forgot-password, verification and resend endpoints to 6 requests per minute.
+- Forgot password always answers with the same status, so it never reveals whether an e-mail is registered. A successful reset rotates `remember_token`.
+- The default locale is `pt_BR` (fallback `en`); UI strings come from `lang/*/ui.php`.
